157
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:22,960
When you get involved in a conflict, there are two major concerns you have to take

158
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:28,840
into account. your personal goals and keeping a good relationship with the other

159
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:34,660
