179
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:06,100
They seek a solution to conflicts where both sides gain something.

180
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:12,360
Five, the view conflicts as problems to be solved.

181
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:17,500
They see conflicts as improving relationships by reducing tension between two

182
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:22,760
